    <!-- ════════════════════ FAQ ════════════════════ -->
    <section class="s_text_block sec sec-white" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Text Block">
        <div class="wrap">
            <div class="sec-intro rv">
                <span class="badge badge-blue">FAQ</span>
                <h2>Pricing questions, answered</h2>
                <p>Everything you need to know before getting started.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-list rv">
                <details class="faq-item">
                    <summary>Are there any long-term contracts?</summary>
                    <div class="faq-body">No. All Converza plans are month-to-month. You can pause or cancel at any time
                        with 30 days' notice. We believe in earning your business every month through results, not
                        locking you in.</div>
                </details>
                <details class="faq-item">
                    <summary>Can I upgrade or downgrade my plan?</summary>
                    <div class="faq-body">Absolutely. You can move between plans at any time. Upgrades take effect
                        immediately, and you'll only be charged the pro-rated difference. Downgrades apply from the
                        next billing cycle.</div>
                </details>
                <details class="faq-item">
                    <summary>Do you offer custom or enterprise pricing?</summary>
                    <div class="faq-body">Yes. For businesses with specific requirements multiple brands, custom
                        reporting, white-label delivery, or needs that don't fit a standard plan we offer fully
                        custom engagements. <a href="/contactus" style="color:var(--blue)">Contact us</a> to
                        discuss.</div>
                </details>
                <details class="faq-item">
                    <summary>What's included in the free strategy audit?</summary>
                    <div class="faq-body">Our free audit covers your current SEO performance, paid media efficiency,
                        content gaps, and conversion funnel. You'll receive a written report with prioritised
                        recommendations and a proposed 90-day roadmap completely free, no obligation to
                        sign.</div>
                </details>
                <details class="faq-item">
                    <summary>How quickly will I see results?</summary>
                    <div class="faq-body">Paid media campaigns typically show measurable results within 2–4 weeks. SEO
                        compounds over 3–6 months before significant traffic gains. Email and CRO improvements are
                        often visible within the first 30 days. We'll set clear timelines during onboarding.</div>
                </details>
                <details class="faq-item">
                    <summary>Do you work with small businesses or solo founders?</summary>
                    <div class="faq-body">Yes. Our Foundation plan is designed for early-stage businesses and solo
                        founders who need professional marketing execution without hiring a full team. We've helped
                        companies grow from pre-revenue to $10M+ ARR.</div>
                </details>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════════════════ WHY US ════════════════════ -->
    <section class="s_text_block sec sec-alt" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Text Block">
        <div class="wrap">
            <div class="sec-intro rv">
                <span class="badge badge-teal">Why Converza</span>
                <h2>More than an agency a growth partner</h2>
                <p>We work as an extension of your team. You get specialists, not generalists people who live and
                    breathe the channels they manage.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bento">
                <div class="bc dark span2 rv d1">
                    <div class="bc-icon"><i class="fa fa-shield"/></div>
                    <h3>No lock-in, ever</h3>
                    <p>Month-to-month contracts on every plan. We've built our business around retaining clients
                        through results, not paperwork.</p>
                    <ul class="feature-list">
                        <li>Cancel anytime with 30 days' notice</li>
                        <li>Pause campaigns without penalty</li>
                        <li>Full ownership of all assets and data</li>
                        <li>Transparent, itemised monthly invoices</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="bc teal rv d2">
                    <div class="big-stat">48h<span></span></div>
                    <div class="stat-sub">Strategy in your hands within 48 hours of kickoff</div>
                </div>
                <div class="bc rv d3">
                    <div class="bc-icon"><i class="fa fa-users"/></div>
                    <h3>Dedicated specialists</h3>
                    <p>Every plan includes specialists who work exclusively on your channels not account managers who
                        dabble.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bc blue rv d1">
                    <div class="big-stat">200<span>+</span></div>
                    <div class="stat-sub">Brands trust us to grow their pipeline</div>
                </div>
                <div class="bc rv d2">
                    <div class="bc-icon"><i class="fa fa-line-chart"/></div>
                    <h3>Results or we fix it</h3>
                    <p>If we miss agreed KPIs in the first 60 days, we work an additional month at no charge. Period.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════════════════ CTA ════════════════════ -->
    <section class="s_text_block sec sec-dark" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Text Block" id="contact">
        <div class="wrap" style="text-align:center">
            <span class="badge badge-white rv" style="margin-bottom:20px">Start Today</span>
            <h2 class="rv d1" style="color:white;font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,3rem);max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 16px">
                Not sure which plan is right for you?</h2>
            <p class="rv d2"
                style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);max-width:500px;margin:0 auto 36px;font-size:1.05rem">Get a free
                strategy audit and we'll recommend the best plan for your stage, goals, and budget no pressure.</p>
            <div class="rv d3" style="display:flex;gap:16px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
                <a class="btn btn-teal" href="/contactus">
                    <i class="fa fa-arrow-right"/>
                    Get Free Strategy Audit
                </a>
                <a class="btn btn-ghost-white" href="/services">Explore Services</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    
                    </div>
